<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark falls on profit warning.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark falls on profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish telecommunications group Tele Danmark shares fell around three percent on Monday morning after the company issued a report forecasting losses of up to 1.9 billion crowns per year due to new market regulation proposals.</p>
<p>At 1020 GMT, the share was 11 crowns down from Friday's close at 329 crowns, a 3.2 percent drop.</p>
<p>-- Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
